==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Bears Be Back]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be considered easier than the previous one. As long as you have all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] and a few meatshields, you can stall the Bears with relative ease and slowly chip away at them with ranged attackers.

